WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.060
Each number from Ace to Ten carries a
theme that repeats in every tarot suit.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.604
Knowing them helps you read a minor arcana
card you have not met before.

00:00:11.904 --> 00:00:12.961
The ten numbers.

00:00:12.961 --> 00:00:21.413
Ace: beginnings, two: balance and choice, three: growth and teamwork,
four: stability and pause, then five: conflict and change.

00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:24.419
Reading number and suit together.

00:00:24.419 --> 00:00:27.055
The number is the plot and the suit is the
setting.

00:00:28.355 --> 00:00:29.226
A simple arc.

00:00:29.226 --> 00:00:32.442
Many readers see the numbers as a small
journey.

00:00:33.842 --> 00:00:36.258
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:36.258 --> 00:00:41.156
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
